  "caveat": "MEASURED LIMIT OF THE SPEC'S CONTROL 5.1 AS WRITTEN. The first 14 characters of an InChIKey are the hash of the molecular SKELETON (connectivity). Two compounds share it only when they are the same connectivity differing in salt form, stereochemistry, isotope or charge. Structural ANALOGS in the ordinary medicinal-chemistry sense - two statins, two tinibs, two taxanes - have DIFFERENT first blocks and are NOT collapsed by this rule. The compound set is already keyed by cmap_name, so near-duplicates are mostly gone before the rule is applied. The effective-compound count below is therefore a near-duplicate check, not an analog check, and it should be read as a LOWER BOUND on analog redundancy. A real analog control needs a structural fingerprint (e.g. Morgan / Tanimoto) and a similarity cut-off: a new dependency and a threshold, both of which belong to S1, not to S0."
 },
